Description: MadMartigan 4k Intro/2004/Linux
 4k intro by MadMartigan (Vincent Siles), released in 2004 for the
 #demoscene 4k source compo, where it ranked 7th.
 .
 A textured tunnel with a fake radial blur, a wireframe sphere and
 generated sound, in less than 4 KB of C++ source using SDL and OpenGL.
 Press Escape to switch to the next scene.
